    },
    {
      "id": "bipa5.u09.l04",
      "sha256": "8694549d38a9e064def78c335f7aea58e70df858f16ad8d26b8d42139d3998dd"
    },
    {
      "id": "bipa5.u09.l05",
      "sha256": "81ea88bda6e3fa373e6d6d3c2a16707885e608066440908cddb880598b46e8fb"
    },
    {
      "id": "bipa5.u09.l06",
      "sha256": "50b6e15359ea424a3b1ed4efdc713a76d3249cabcb1d1f390c88a5d1698e4bee"
    },
    {
      "id": "bipa5.u09.l07",
      "sha256": "90586337f60ff3836f817a0922c8f295edcc4d646a6a4178d196b66c31987514"
    },
    {
      "id": "bipa5.u09.l08",
      "sha256": "5a44665bc45108c585b23d60320f426f128d5b05b001b5ff2140de8e77366679"
    },
    {
      "id": "bipa5.u09.l09",
      "sha256": "41e408ab35d21874d97e164af1c1877cb1a738e76da42a5ebf91b5d7d65f971f"
    },
    {
      "id": "bipa5.u09.l10",
      "sha256": "fea56bd72b61bf22674727e7d68a8bfb966dc1d221afc2ef39db06e9b9c70d57"
    },
    {
      "id": "bipa5.u09.l11",
      "sha256": "47cba75f21db3150cd889387a32a0e559e3d8783df83b178aab44e2f4deb17ce"
    },
    {
      "id": "bipa5.u09.l12",
      "sha256": "4a09fff69d946153fc149ca6d25024bff66a70b9fa28974d0e3eee90f36c7d67"
    }
  ],
  "audio": [
    {
      "key": "02b965c81910ebe321068a820b643d75528b9b2b694d380da22c4d5ea4faf34e",
      "text": "karangan",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 8,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "03944364f0312fba5560b37a5275c2e61599a85f198376769af0fdd8b6609a76",
      "text": "Bahasa Indonesia sangat beragam dan tidak takut pada kata asing, karena sejak dulu bahasa ini hidup di pelabuhan.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 113,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "03c015571e16d0cfb763e73b420f3d988520bff17b4b89bf594596a895f452ed",
      "text": "Dia suka menyelipkan kata bahasa Inggris supaya terdengar keren.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 64,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "080875100efd24761420f2add32da008a27bfd0efcb6f698645695e284391f68",
      "text": "Salah satu ___ bahasa Melayu Pontianak adalah bunyi \"e\" di akhir kata.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 80,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "085d48ccf8fbb5d0ce8b67a1d21e07db3f0fc59615c89540ce8f731dd0f90494",
      "text": "Di rumah dia berbahasa Jawa dengan orang tuanya. Tetapi di kantor dia melakukan alih kode ke bahasa Indonesia, karena rekan kerjanya dari daerah lain.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 150,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "0b8ec33e73c33f815c07489af92aaf07922df6fe7e00186cbce52ddf0993974f",
      "text": "Jadi huruf Arab ikut nyebar bareng bahasa Melayu. Menarik banget!",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 65,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "0c63651c2c9f9a7ef3ff2fffce3740c89026d7817e0226f20672bee1c9c86947",
      "text": "Pelestarian bahasa daerah dimulai dari rumah. Kalau orang tua tidak berbicara bahasa daerah dengan anaknya, sekolah saja tidak cukup.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 133,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "0c7bb429e36458a2b0a091ebfe9f28606b758356b952fa9aaa47e19e919bbe22",
      "text": "Dulu banyak kitab Melayu ditulis dengan huruf Jawi.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 51,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "0cba17d90483f73707bd64a5caa7920d89387eb6216962cccc4d9447dc0bb3e1",
      "text": "menantu",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 7,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "0f35d4cde9f09352abc7f8c7c2ff5a4cf10f2c345fdf6bf7ae51cf4352d5d21d",
      "text": "Aku mau nulis karangan soal ini: deskripsi ungkapan sama dialog contohnya.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 74,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "0fadc2440ce19f30f8017ae62805e59bef0654d605a0d4fadd620cd9d646aee6",
      "text": "Elo ngerti nggak maksud gue?",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 28,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "12df7f40afd98801b13aa83112c4b9a4920fa6538c6cedd1a6ede35d1cb4f236",
      "text": "Mungkin kita perlu bikin anak muda ngerasa bahasa daerah itu kebanggaan, bukan barang kuno.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 91,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "13bf9b1846555cec03b1c7f52401643537c973a794d8362273b3683c4ae83987",
      "text": "Pada zaman dulu, nasihat orang tua sangat dihormati, sehingga anak muda jarang membantah.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 89,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "1574930e44c18ed6b4420dc229fb92dade47278e4517857b8109452138a3577e",
      "text": "penutur",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 7,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "17702b6b77ac6ff9ab8877873a0f5156d84de56adc791c3f9c7da5b210ebafa7",
      "text": "Lihat, Mas! Tulisan di naskah ini huruf Arab, tapi aku nggak paham artinya.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 75,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "19571d868a782faf6c540964de1599f075fa50ae802780e219790b7a82172bca",
      "text": "Nah, itu salah kaprah. Tapi tulisan \"izin\" sama \"zaman\" kamu udah sempurna.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 95,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "1ef79eece44742e9c9326151d2f576c09cd3cd4e0b046bc2fd5fc239964eea36",
      "text": "huruf",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 5,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "20352eb2d3c239bf1e3181f20f4bf5c7bb27353ce02032026fa2b4323c4177bc",
      "text": "Maaf, boleh saya mengubah kesalahan kecil di surat ini?",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 55,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "207c5da570f2d551762583481a4d443c2171f49253c2aef68a31a829df9c8b1e",
      "text": "bahasa gaul",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 11,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "2443cb4762840d1670f67972be1794c037400b7abbf7b03dd549a3a099334296",
      "text": "bahasa baku",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 11,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "25222020368786e2fb7efad0b7251f69542f8cff0d9dea18124cec831d319ec6",
      "text": "gini",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 4,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "25f1992166ee8d2d7588106f68c4e901313cd70bd64917f37dc4848796dc36c3",
      "text": "Dengan teman saya santai, tetapi dengan ahli bahasa saya memakai bahasa baku.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 77,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "26537324e202a2d47b0c719ddc55e1d108ce29027c3e8251360e94042d17c998",
      "text": "Ini Istana Kadriah. Pendiri Pontianak keturunan Arab dari Hadramaut.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 68,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "2800c87b56d7c94f492fe758369c1ff8d87238c9f89e913201c82d02372a9132",
      "text": "pertemanan",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 10,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "28eccb2ea83b0a03f735471880cb8872e944e34b408da6278f830a197181428f",
      "text": "berasal dari",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 12,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "2addddc4952611e718241d25213a92f3337dcbcd30428de7c5852a97f90565bc",
      "text": "Selamat datang di Pontianak, kota di garis khatulistiwa.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 56,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "2b7fa01b302168efe548660ed14d41f5bbfaa84d8c621fb89dcd02787589bc79",
      "text": "dialog",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 6,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "2ba8dbd583d7c3b05e13c4022ab684eb0e9693a8c5027983e4e369aaac3d4926",
      "text": "Kata \"kalimat\" mirip dengan bahasa Arab, tetapi maknanya berbeda.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 75,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "2e1dd0f70ef61a72effd41f071fa624ec1ea5536817c9d44df243fc57dd9ddd8",
      "text": "\"Begini saja\" dan \"lagi pula\". Kayaknya kamu siap jadi anak Jakarta!",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 88,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "319c0ac37ab059f37eb120948a068f8c9d327d55dddb7784a2add6fcbc1d6bc1",
      "text": "campur kode",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 11,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "341a037fb192bfc212a0035e0d6376b972714796cbf8eeac388289721b82e4ed",
      "text": "Lebaran dan Imlek di Pontianak adalah waktu ___ semua warga.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 60,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "34260ffa14af807742a174ee6dff6cf78a341985cb5fd137bccf70e57838e065",
      "text": "Bunyi \"f\" dalam bahasa Arab sering berubah menjadi \"p\". Jadi kata \"fikr\" menjadi \"pikir\", dan \"faham\" menjadi \"paham\".",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 178,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "36930ff18073019f041a67f119603492a683bade8d429d2548edd31ba6d69e08",
      "text": "Mirip, tapi nggak identik. Tiap bahasa punya karakteristik sendiri.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 67,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "36edfc972fb8459d6e445a89e2586ec052fa811d024e81a20377afae5f452530",
      "text": "Sejak masa kecil, saya ingin menambah kosakata asing.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 53,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "383322f7cba10a781b72a93d9de3a2d942112a12e1bd1048042d1904318cd7ac",
      "text": "asing",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 5,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "38f043b415d74d855064fb74083741fd2f7f43a04ea76fde4be9d046b3967439",
      "text": "cuman",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 5,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "398dd69d771218495270361c96c1f89e2967ba41cd2a05d9009fa939765c517d",
      "text": "Bagus banget. Cuma ada satu kesalahan, \"silahkan\" harusnya \"silakan\".",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 89,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "3aa0503d26abdb9ac6f44fbe469f6f1ac682100aed2322f073474ff26b970fc0",
      "text": "kepo",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 4,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "3b99999984050c002766cb792c2d02fcd0ba0a762f3365f48dfdb42256927226",
      "text": "Mas, aku nerjemahin \"panjang tangan\" jadi \"إيده طويلة\". Salah, ya?",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 86,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "3c6c949cf7f0316a5cc6cebc374409f34c90bbd7d33f0dca7ff705a54946f6f8",
      "text": "Mereka hidup damai nggak?",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 25,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "40aaceb5f764640d73c557aded06732d544ca22f9abfd149d8970a43d6c07621",
      "text": "___ mau ikut nonton nggak?",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 26,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "4434ad90e9fabd37096feb138a0a72d9f83ff518c14f654bc62ec118a50ae9c2",
      "text": "Kadang-kadang. Tapi kadang mereka cuma pengin kedengeran santai.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 64,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "449ef21995142d30d1ab3abd6af66e0f06c0cf5bb0f2ce5a82e4a3de019d506f",
      "text": "kayaknya",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 8,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "44d68cebeccd784fdacd21dc2c258dfdabcc3df8e68b9baeaa309849d3c44324",
      "text": "Sedikit, tetapi saya suka. Kopi susu satu, Pak.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 47,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "4937eb2337a75bbbc2ab613930dff36d43084ec36111d9c683bade6532f256f8",
      "text": "elo",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 3,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "498ca196c82b64eecadfcde4f915ef328c117ab0b894aed44321fcc9d684d8bb",
      "text": "Adik saya kepo sekali tentang kehidupan saya di Mesir.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 54,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "4a329d8d984ff1377d794ca859a4f5f313a5aaad2226d95c8f6f0ab2f09cf695",
      "text": "Mohamed, ini chat adikku. Kamu ngerti nggak?",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 44,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "4af79834d5f8947ed559df83ec9367c6248122b0dbf359496ecd8b95ce8c5970",
      "text": "Bahasa Indonesia adalah bahasa resmi, tetapi akarnya bahasa Melayu.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 67,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "4b29b06f98db4cdcebd0adb6e7ce3f6cc2b514c8184447dede232bbf7fdaaedb",
      "text": "Logat Pak Hendra seperti orang Banjar, padahal dia lahir di Pontianak. Dia tinggal di Banjarmasin selama dua puluh tahun.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 121,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "4d17cbdedd4e7b8235722fe56e8e517d5e6868eb3d18ab9d51b2a089487e93a2",
      "text": "Orang tuaku iya. Tapi adik-adikku lebih sering campur kode sama bahasa Inggris.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 79,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "4df94554d25db54f98b2202aa321ff40b3af6ba2b4508e8ed9771c1f46e0c508",
      "text": "menyelipkan",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 11,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "4e19d3580a0c50e3da282e3df79c62071e5d5e0e5602988062e3b1c853a6934b",
      "text": "Gue mager banget hari ini.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 26,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "509c2dc97b32daf836afabec4c86e6fe8a23db571997d28f0cec92e0e1941060",
      "text": "kosakata",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 8,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "52a80fb0b358b986dc6e16ecdb07ad06add8176018d1eeabfd0f26585f28826e",
      "text": "Persaudaraan kayak gitu manusiawi banget.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 41,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "5327d6c18988af78cb3e951b199755a9be5d4686334641ca20b3a6844a8c3fc8",
      "text": "mirip",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 5,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "53552cfc29c46c05fb20c7018b00ea820190d2566e18c17a2cd480e88006caa6",
      "text": "Banyak penutur muda tidak lagi memakai bahasa ibu mereka, karena mereka merasa bahasa Indonesia lebih modern.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 109,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "543440d41d259b567beca799bd9f27b9f093a086f8c085b4f9db6901048bb45f",
      "text": "Bagus! Elo = kamu, cuman = hanya. Temennya selalu telat.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 56,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "56a787726b6859046fdea5a118ce52f025e4c2c2bced30b5f00126c026f8d1e6",
      "text": "singkatan",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 9,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "57aa1f8e3695815dac6cd5978ec75c9e89a4687689898539b0ae4edfa1a80f0e",
      "text": "karakteristik",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 13,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "57c51b59add8405310fe16961de7f94dbaa18e138a73179f2b9790beb00bbb35",
      "text": "identik",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 7,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "591edea1c6c55c83621661fa95cd7ea3eaf1f863f6fd61cdf1e30c53b2c3a9b4",
      "text": "Pada masa lalu, bahasa asing memberi banyak kata baru, karena Nusantara menjadi tempat bertemu para pedagang.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 109,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "5c84c3e884073c93a6bc4dcf7c0073c6764296d74193e8da8ca0d07580ddc0bc",
      "text": "harfiah",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 7,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "5d4a936cea6c311034a66aaaf87a4c746eac5b243d9cd3e61b19b63e284ee0b2",
      "text": "Maaf, gue capek banget. Eh, benar nggak bahasa gaul saya?",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 57,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "5d7d9e0032ab0ec2c05296963b96ef80dd9ad3902b0ae549732330d07e021a34",
      "text": "Ha! Itu campur kode. Di Kairo juga banyak yang nyelipin kata bahasa Inggris.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 76,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "5dd98b8561def606fad6c744503972c2218adc522aa9db3640222456c8aa0cf7",
      "text": "tingkatan",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 9,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "5eb09df54c1a82cf6b4e74e53ccd20d7932e46bc55e311a1cf0a94f939ff73fc",
      "text": "salah kaprah",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 12,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "5f8b9c90d720ca1ad866ee6bbc4b5a6e3b2923385a3d658d40540751a2c13bfb",
      "text": "Dalam chat yang penuh campur kode, \"cuman\" adalah bentuk gaul dari ___.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 81,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "60934d43870205f11593a1630ed6af582b628a0c5269e2580f491f2fcab9898e",
      "text": "Rina, keluargamu masih ngomong bahasa Melayu Pontianak nggak?",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 61,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "60c8edd95b6067e6a59067fb97a025c69712a4a81b1f845445f822938b72df05",
      "text": "ejaan",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 5,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "66243ac4b06dc7281e8a76bb78fde9cf79061742d77a5b6d8f05c8d98b4e9946",
      "text": "Terjemahan harfiahnya lucu sekali. Kalau diterjemahkan kata per kata, artinya menjadi aneh, jadi kita harus mencari maknanya.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 125,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "68a69cacedc18f5380b0245852d514f2e70df4ae45bfe01ea6938801241ab369",
      "text": "Terjemahan harfiah ungkapan itu tidak identik dengan artinya. \"Buah tangan\" bukan buah dari tangan, tetapi oleh-oleh untuk keluarga.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 142,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "69f2f5f34868771d7d309ddefb9183751dfc3e6c6aed46f0e24f57876e189c66",
      "text": "Sebagian besar, iya. Pertemanan sama pernikahan campur udah biasa. Menantu tetanggaku orang Dayak.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 98,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "6d574bb1d5757983d969fffe3d7cc47c916a3bec07615f208d87db01f863a40e",
      "text": "persaudaraan",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 12,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "6ee7efd3e32b405b4a7dd377230755b4a350216e241e4a0e3944a2a3b5046a98",
      "text": "Karangannya berisi deskripsi pasar dan dialog dengan penjual, sehingga pembaca seperti ikut berbelanja.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 103,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "70156c69e574002e89380cb0d09f29aec3a643b8d7608e1312bae3d34fac9a34",
      "text": "Jadi kamu cepet belajar soalnya udah kenal kosakatanya?",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 55,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "70b8da84b6ba1ae90d6fee93f4a4b6445f07254184ab7c296601c3c4da11bbbb",
      "text": "Penutur bahasa daerah perlu bangga dan melestarikan bahasanya.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 62,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "7254c20431a42a9ca0e4d6831258cb47cc9b23ad35dde9007e4f81a564a2f968",
      "text": "Kata \"waktu\" berasal dari bahasa Arab.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 48,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "72634c218285986c9f36241f9f5862bc36a03c2936d7ed079fa0a1fdfec3698b",
      "text": "manusiawi",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 9,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "726a1be34f5c5fa28a9c9df10f71c715ee9e668a9b719f4f29846e2923c333f9",
      "text": "kesalahan",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 9,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "733d383b0b9bca5e7da8d7da1a2cfa5c0dc91fd248fb16777ee324c545d1979f",
      "text": "Dalam rapat resmi, sebaiknya kita tidak menyelipkan terlalu banyak kata asing.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 78,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "763030f7c53bfde75aec6e882fdbcc27a58aed64b836f21f896ccf3323f512cd",
      "text": "bahasa ibu",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 10,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "7a36607479c81d678f0f1e40cbc2f34f0a70969855580c4cca0d93e55b68c9f4",
      "text": "sob",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 3,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "7abfdb097f25c6e6d8fffdbcfca3c75b46fc643befcbd41e0fcc7901e5c5e469",
      "text": "Iya. Melayu dominan, tapi ada juga bahasa Dayak sama bahasa Tionghoa yang leluhurnya dari Tiongkok selatan.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 107,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "7b944168c0f03b56fec3f465309259ace5e851d9ff3f3d07544730f701824604",
      "text": "deskripsi",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 9,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "7cba2cdfa10c7be3f9719e0ead60ee63c07e7b7f865256f3029ef2d314ad0d21",
      "text": "kebanggaan",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 10,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "7d59771d7153f2c731156fbcb83eb03fac326a81a2e8970c9968d4e7fa90e45f",
      "text": "bahasa Melayu",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 13,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "7e6d37febdcb957c0c9efb878c809affe109411cc04c0a65401e1cd48c96645f",
      "text": "Itu huruf Jawi. Bahasanya Melayu, bukan Arab.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 45,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "7eae66b7283e50ed503392933b5483c9a295ea44be7dce986efe26fd576f2f87",
      "text": "lafal",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 5,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "822fe7fd80b3ea2dff4fb0affede68fb6974b1238d64eeae0ea5e3ff6ed3f95e",
      "text": "Ahli bahasa itu menjelaskan bunyi bahasa Arab, karena banyak bunyi itu tidak ada dalam bahasa Indonesia.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 104,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "823a4ab37c61f2bc6f02c4da56c12270e5728ad2e91a010241cfad2a27f85723",
      "text": "Kayaknya hujan, sob. Kita naik ojek aja, soalnya jalan kaki ke sana jauh banget.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 80,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "8468d36278818964c4f706d1b578a91971938a13b74facdd6348f1fcfcd63332",
      "text": "Ungkapan \"panjang tangan\" tidak boleh diterjemahkan secara harfiah.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 77,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "86cb0e3206db6b12a0e7ea85f95317182cc4bb6bfc98edc1b7a251ecb89630f7",
      "text": "Kayaknya elo cuman capek. Lagian ini udah malam.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 48,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "881058d7b0843cc4a2de2087df63898bd4b6273647f5fa7689d3c467a355d47c",
      "text": "Dengan teman, saya lebih santai dan memakai bahasa gaul, tetapi di kantor saya selalu memakai bahasa baku.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 106,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "888c8b47c7f61f1a97993a7e6e63f82bac6549a15736318d8d311931f1a6b8b0",
      "text": "Itu kata serapan dari bahasa Arab, kan? Khaṭṭ al-istiwā'.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 62,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "89a79192f778a4ed124bc4b5826ba3698039e044f79e06ffbac86f3f97bd0147",
      "text": "Pontianak adalah kota yang beragam, karena orang Melayu, Tionghoa, dan Dayak tinggal bersama di sana.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 101,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "8bc7355c3b6fe27df0fdcc2a276d6a79bbda91e4b79ac7b0b911aaeac691cbaf",
      "text": "Menurutku, campur kode itu wajar. Yang penting bahasa ibu nggak ilang.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 70,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "8cafa93782d974c93eb1a5eb947c8bf663d249bfee349f624078e8a27be65010",
      "text": "\"Elo di mana, sob? Gue cuman nunggu sepuluh menit lagi.\" Hmm, lumayan ngerti.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 87,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "8d665d1273457de68b42cc1ee024549d9dbe12c770e39a4e5e9193e1323da465",
      "text": "Di kota ini, bahasa Melayu paling dominan, tetapi banyak keluarga Tionghoa masih berbicara bahasa Tiociu di rumah.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 114,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "8dec0603923a3bb0072646665c7562dd4c157e55d9218c2d040962e57e0d6466",
      "text": "dominan",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 7,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "8e1f97ac49f5b30915530c8d92511fede022a98e358c949abf9fb368fa2e54ce",
      "text": "Dulu banyak kitab Melayu ditulis dengan huruf Jawi, sehingga orang Arab bisa membaca hurufnya walaupun tidak mengerti bahasanya.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 128,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "9137937747903f99c41382419a08973a8b02333d44506b941ac8acbd97bb92a6",
      "text": "Bahasa gaul itu santai, tetapi surat lamaran harus memakai bahasa baku.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 71,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "95b0cd5e79e4caddb2c434d0954cfaeeaee16695a5200717e8145e9feafe7b0f",
      "text": "Kata \"meja\" berasal dari bahasa Portugis, bukan dari bahasa Belanda. Orang Portugis datang ke Nusantara lebih dulu, sekitar lima ratus tahun yang lalu.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 161,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "96a7eb43ef85691305e0850197db993a7071dbd6e0e872273e79810ce14f3513",
      "text": "Hampir! Tapi jangan pakai \"gue\" dan \"saya\" bareng. Satu aja.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 80,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "9b47f356c6cec228a7f18eef8dbbf627ba3c6e56af3ac112a589a01395548f3d",
      "text": "Kenapa, ya? Gara-gara gengsi, kali?",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 35,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "9df7d40b76a742af84b75eaea4076d354549009a670af422d65c419e72c71193",
      "text": "Tiongkok",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 8,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "a332df220888c10c23d3b2059d730ba7979e6908668a7d751fa94cdac553212e",
      "text": "Iya, tapi hati-hati! \"Ahli\" di sini bukan keluarga, tapi orang yang pinter.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 85,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "a39f08a1bbd344d482132232db4de0064f6974bc04f19ebb6bcaefef2e719c9a",
      "text": "Itu terjemahan harfiah. Ungkapan itu artinya pencuri, lho.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 58,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "a582980460fb1c8e898ae67568f4f69304f7402e80c27e95e81f83102371ffe5",
      "text": "Kata serapan dari bahasa Arab terdengar akrab bagi saya.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 56,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "a639c142689d214517385d168e914f7b5790580709520e7a60cd694355ff25cd",
      "text": "Wah, kukira itu bener. Banyak orang nulis gitu, kok!",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 52,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "a6d1f5934fa983decef9799eb7f86ca0c6438467f84f4a25b926f7d530be7d6e",
      "text": "Tadi di pasar aku denger banyak bahasa.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 39,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "a7ec1505e0eb6a085bfc8067ee01e49b19e9fe8a47790c984644e34e4458292e",
      "text": "Mohamed, kamu ikut nongkrong nanti malam nggak?",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 47,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "a9b7d57ef8c8f00435bb5ac68f9ed0c7d668a2a937c73e52e1cccd8105789e1f",
      "text": "Oh, maaf! Mau minum apa? Logat saya kental, ya?",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 47,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "ae19004d0ec89b806ddf6f12a90ba825f63561ac5e5e46da54232c51a7f1b530",
      "text": "Terus \"gini aja\" sama \"lagian\"?",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 51,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "afab8abf1dfc9d62e3e1a896acd95cd80ede9f2c73c35fb1787c9c97954d4a97",
      "text": "masa",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 4,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "b038fa9299ffb46216a1c9248f13d67db3a0e3ad4b2187d854c12ccf6bd005ce",
      "text": "Leluhur keluarga Pak Liong datang dari Tiongkok selatan.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 56,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "b221352c05793ebbfccd2e7a7339d115b963eccb81c927a0b8af94df345822d6",
      "text": "Tapi di kantor tetep bahasa baku, ya.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 37,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "b3b0b7c13ae47cbfc6fc91d137d7f7f0cc681425bfd27e45161ad6fea0a32422",
      "text": "Menantu Pak Liong orang Dayak; keluarganya merayakan kebersamaan.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 65,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "b765081e0c334011982d046df83d48eaadd2e6a5d28c3bedee6ab43765ae3240",
      "text": "Bahasa Melayu menyebar ke seluruh Nusantara lewat perdagangan. Para pedagang dari pulau yang berbeda memakainya supaya bisa saling mengerti.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 140,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "b7f3024d0e0de614801dbec151aad0fafc81c55f5d63aa19a28db6feec6b2cad",
      "text": "Jangan kepo, itu urusan pribadi dia. Kalau dia mau cerita, nanti dia sendiri yang bilang.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 89,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "b91fafb0e94a22402c76f4fec4ee50f404d2eb5f28511c5e7e709a8d7a23f652",
      "text": "terdengar",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 9,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "b92c8de59740566cf8567a4be2d4a86e1d175a56a8744a344e8bd315853859b5",
      "text": "Bahasa campur kode terdengar santai, tetapi kurang baku, jadi jangan memakainya dalam surat resmi.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 98,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "bb622ae1f84689492184df35c1f8287939aeb259d87e064d35c8184c26458a0f",
      "text": "bahasa pengantar",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 16,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "bbff8dcf1141e6900eee99c9ffa283ff3be22ba102bad42118c4bd501d7a90d8",
      "text": "santai",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 6,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "bf9296454c90daa98a9c30d5e7604d3f5bd6504c8593228a65f904f0752aecdd",
      "text": "Setuju. Pelestarian bahasa daerah emang harus mulai dari rumah.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 63,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "c2127c0f208eef94bf5943d8a575623000610ae94e04e22a44951a9b80a8c71b",
      "text": "Kata \"bahasa\" berasal dari bahasa Sanskerta, zaman kerajaan Hindu.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 76,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "c42f83a85d4b040c9b281360be333fc04c72ff709aa307b940dfea596301de1a",
      "text": "gengsi",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 6,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "c7d274bbd18c242e7ddc7b744901d0751200887b3c53d268a3ff82600f2282b4",
      "text": "logat",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 5,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "c820504e497b26385a62fed58e5fbe110d52d53c1dd934b189cb7d3dbd3396d9",
      "text": "Jadi bahasa Indonesia nggak takut sama kata asing, ya.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 54,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "c8399d2a43019e0bc954885e3198c0e03f6929faf21f712d05239289a7000468",
      "text": "Masjid ini didirikan pada masa Sultan Syarif Abdurrahman. Keluarganya berasal dari Hadramaut.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 93,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "c85570b2ed794ab869ec796fca606f1df4069ceab9e10ff56e0b93c1a99c5699",
      "text": "Lucu! Di bahasa Arab Mesir juga ada ungkapan yang mirip.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 56,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "c9298416981b7debc523cbd6411b194715ece64c5218ca5efbf8087551a9a51c",
      "text": "Sepupuku dari Jaksel. Dia bilang, \"Aku tuh literally nggak ngerti, which is aneh banget.\"",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 99,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "c95809c11e87cd70c8672b2ed7e62cd5103db9874bdefbb5791e24cca4ebd402",
      "text": "Karangannya berisi deskripsi pasar dan dialog dengan penjual.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 61,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "c95b3b266026ba7d4a0e8fad321ba599a8acca665f790df78b910b707e125a0b",
      "text": "Pertemanan kami sudah dua puluh tahun. Dia orang Tionghoa dan saya orang Melayu, tetapi kami seperti saudara.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 109,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "cbc36afc8142d72e52f3001b73f6a0eaec87dc7cf35bd690533c5a4f8b9fe19e",
      "text": "Bener. Aku juga bangga sama bahasa Arab Mesir-ku!",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 49,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "cd35a31bd4dffb17d76248bfa82bdd130b33241caa60b77be2de40bb5419616d",
      "text": "Oke, paham. Di sini \"gue\", di kantor \"saya\" dan bahasa baku.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 80,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "ce3d3e81d7a1adfbdb018bc1934ad972f95251d3b544e55d8fbb1bb2bbca6d61",
      "text": "Lafal orang Mesir dan orang Indonesia berbeda, tetapi katanya mirip. Misalnya, orang Mesir bilang \"fikr\", dan orang Indonesia bilang \"pikir\".",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 161,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "ceebf2dd3068a694266b9187be992d2dda9fe0a1a6a18041a4b5401913ef22be",
      "text": "Kayaknya temen gue telat lagi.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 30,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "d15172d731e1c819f47e2603cbf895af76d1d157bab1630ee9e4b52098c2c3b9",
      "text": "alih kode",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 9,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "d1f5e9652ab47488b924009e65ebff109992f2851846fce00bbc59365a46435e",
      "text": "Di Pontianak, bahasa Melayu dominan, tapi bahasa Tiochiu juga sering terdengar.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 79,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "d60622303279791d4d7ad93c9553bacc1ffe955dd25dad5c5b70d7127197e872",
      "text": "Bahasa ibu saya bahasa Arab Mesir.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 34,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "db7c920fe9ea21099103df601e3b26ad481d268f360fe417e20fba1156fb3430",
      "text": "bahasa resmi",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 12,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "dc513c40d46bf7c45201fedda13d056e50ed47b05d4d040608dededab61ed756",
      "text": "Saya minta izin pulang lebih awal hari ini. Anak saya sakit, dan saya harus membawanya ke dokter jam tiga.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 106,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "ddace668f241d037f0d552fa999a2ba91265092bbdafc5b95ba3cb0843f8d7e1",
      "text": "Pantas banyak kata serapan dari bahasa Arab di sini!",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 52,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "de603f816fa2b01c7827656feb5108a5a7a9cd32e866ecb829be8ab518b85b1c",
      "text": "huruf Jawi",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 10,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "df460d1bc32e132f97b0a9852665c85d9ad90f008d25e6134ed9718fbd41a2b2",
      "text": "Mohamed, coba jelasin Jembatan Arab ke temen-temen.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 51,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "dff1bce5b2d30cf2ca2a37c8128b993826866b4e01dd7319512585d04785144e",
      "text": "kata serapan",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 12,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "e27724652ddd5b4432b516256723bb074b3ceef751bf573b4f3885c4855cdfb3",
      "text": "pelestarian",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 11,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "e4603a8b3931d24db91ca374f53c426c2dd5d46f33152f1cf33882bec1cd9ddf",
      "text": "Hindu",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 5,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "e4a0c08c773a5daeeff858e1f0a907ac347bdc5f0c6e5ba231ecb1e83ed0d231",
      "text": "Bener. Tapi kosakata kita juga ada yang dari bahasa Tionghoa, Belanda sama Portugis.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 84,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "e63c43c1e7e6517545c5cbe72963033b09ed29012c5ac678bbef54f2abf44a05",
      "text": "Gini aja, sob: kita ketemu jam tujuh.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 37,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "e8f4467e7fbe9d4095cbaa2ecd9951654a9c18dc7c437a748d36c463a033f4f0",
      "text": "bunyi",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 5,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "e97edc304aef8c4d3acadafefe33f7f833eea31a82404f1743d805176016146d",
      "text": "bahasa daerah",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 13,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "edc405ba979f67ffec2b805f48f496ee05cdb509922869d9e63cd5f1d2c8660a",
      "text": "lagian",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 6,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "ee9f0036ac5dcf114ddd0e7be857beaaa9c7ad2799de6d96614d1459e8110474",
      "text": "Mohamed, sekarang kamu berdiri tepat di garis khatulistiwa!",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 59,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "f12328f2911778a0d67e025faf41186df1744001a58c6ecdc919129485909982",
      "text": "ungkapan",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 8,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "f1edf5c34b50e470533870db47a9ba7be45bccbdf37dcef3ad1c717e8fe102a8",
      "text": "Gini aja, sob: kita ketemu besok, soalnya hari ini aku masih kerja sampai malam.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 80,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "f2fa1e27feafe22a9984c217a2a78e7c21e84446045bddc903e58cea960fcc5a",
      "text": "Bener! Bunyinya berubah, tapi maknanya sama.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 44,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "f30f1eead85b9edfc77b76b08c9f41535cc75904f27fafb251ef583b67c49b3e",
      "text": "beragam",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 7,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "f39c2d3ef676d06a59f5e38805a7be00463534d03404d747fdf7c1ad0c9523f7",
      "text": "Bahasa Jawa punya tingkatan; bahasa Indonesia tidak.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 52,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "f4c61ccea3d24bc55e9df3b87a1ad17814cc37ec2bfd6a8b3337d118d0a062ac",
      "text": "Mas Rizal, bisa cek suratku nggak? Aku minta izin tinggal lebih lama.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 69,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "f664314ce2003dc93ae9a542157bd6aa112db35257aa7500344259f8329924c7",
      "text": "menyebar",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 8,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "f719e93da29768aa1b3ccf78e9e967e56500ec7d7c80f456f52edd2c99319a18",
      "text": "Kitak mau minum ape?",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 20,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "f7246d85daabd715795301220b7a45ed1ee5d2d14385f56aad64e04f949abda2",
      "text": "berubah",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 7,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "f7300ccaa13563cedce933cd5435f598bd2d8d36120bd2c68f50e8b8bd04570e",
      "text": "mengubah",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 8,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "f91f00890ec9e3821fc1f1938a453357594be7475181f63bd3f75fdbe95e7917",
      "text": "Bahasa Indonesia emang jembatan antara Mesir sama Pontianak, ya.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 64,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "f9e0070752b049d75bfe081980760b392ac02bd58833bd5a68dd6d458d808c11",
      "text": "Bahasa pengantar di kampus ini adalah bahasa Indonesia.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 55,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "fa238249935360958e9b062493fc3e7831fbde1509cd24770dd5edae883881d3",
      "text": "ngerti",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 6,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "fa5a8f9f8dc5ef8e6306c5e0b22c140dc5e433fd2b6150233fead35b5de45971",
      "text": "temen",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 5,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "fba901f192817e2da56fcaafdddd4c0776860e37be49410c1e34b729e638c1ac",
      "text": "Bahasa Arab adalah kebanggaan saya, dan bahasa Indonesia adalah jembatan saya.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 78,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "fdbe10cafe764a13118f672e992d87aa8592c9ba88beec2d102decfd3c69434d",
      "text": "Dua kata ini hampir identik, tapi tingkatannya berbeda.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 55,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "ff2294fa541ff07d6810239716a49268f24cac0fdd8374075b0ade4f31b381e3",
      "text": "kebersamaan",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 11,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "ff2e909c19893ad81af5df8f8dcb7454368325a1dc80dbe342cac49aa262f920",
      "text": "Maaf, Pak, saya belum paham bahasa daerah di sini.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 50,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "ffc5cf7c1e3e6889ebe8e033473ce742989e0685317172e2c5ea0e6dff7fac5d",
      "text": "Banyak kata Indonesia mirip bahasa Arab, tapi bunyinya berubah. Misalnya, \"fikr\" jadi \"pikir\".",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 114,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    }
  ],
  "totals": {
    "lessons": 12,
    "clips": 173,
